WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.600
I'm definitely gonna be the first-star idol!

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.480
Nijino Yume's about to start her Aikatsu!

00:00:28.710 --> 00:00:33.470
Nothing compares to the cool, refreshing breeze of early-morning Aikatsu.

00:02:42.010 --> 00:02:44.390
Time sure flies.

00:02:44.390 --> 00:02:46.770
Only three months left in the year.

00:02:47.430 --> 00:02:48.890
Doesn't it get you going?

00:02:48.890 --> 00:02:54.190
Whether it does or does not, how are you faring in the Aikatsu Ranking?

00:02:54.190 --> 00:02:56.030
I'm making my way up.

00:02:56.030 --> 00:02:59.030
There's no point participating if you don't go for the top.

00:02:59.030 --> 00:03:00.280
Right, Yume?

00:03:01.860 --> 00:03:03.990
Huh? What'd you say?

00:03:03.990 --> 00:03:08.410
Well well, my my. Have you returned from your journey through the imaginary?

00:03:08.410 --> 00:03:13.380
That's not what distracted me. I was just thinking about something strange I saw this morning.

00:03:15.670 --> 00:03:19.550
She was like a fairy straight out of a fairy tale.

00:03:20.680 --> 00:03:23.010
I wonder what it was.

00:03:23.970 --> 00:03:26.470
That was obviously just a daydream!

00:03:26.470 --> 00:03:28.270
You were still half-asleep.

00:03:28.270 --> 00:03:29.850
You think so?

00:03:31.440 --> 00:03:33.230
Here you all were.

00:03:33.230 --> 00:03:35.360
Everyone, take a look.

00:03:37.020 --> 00:03:39.650
Koharu-chan, that uniform! {I rejoiced out of my seat during the OP}

00:03:39.990 --> 00:03:42.410
H-How does it look?

00:03:42.410 --> 00:03:44.070
Nice, it's great!

00:03:44.070 --> 00:03:45.580
You look wonderful.

00:03:45.580 --> 00:03:46.870
Simply lovely. {I'm sure that's what she meant to say}{scriptwriting is verboten, etc.}

00:03:46.870 --> 00:03:48.330
Really?

00:03:48.330 --> 00:03:51.830
I appointed her to be a Beauty Class admin.

00:03:51.830 --> 00:03:54.580
Koharu will certainly be reliable.

00:03:54.580 --> 00:03:55.540
Yeah.

00:03:55.540 --> 00:03:57.250
Thanks, everyone!

00:03:58.420 --> 00:04:02.340
Oh, Yume-chan. Did you hear the news about My Little Heart?

00:04:02.340 --> 00:04:05.850
Why, did something happen with My Little Heart?

00:04:05.850 --> 00:04:09.100
I only just found out about it myself.

00:04:09.100 --> 00:04:13.020
"My Little Heart changes muses"... huh?

00:04:13.020 --> 00:04:14.350
What?!

00:04:14.350 --> 00:04:15.900
What's this mean?

00:04:15.900 --> 00:04:20.230
It goes on to say that Hime-senpai is passing her brand on to a successor.

00:04:21.110 --> 00:04:22.490
What successor?

00:04:22.490 --> 00:04:28.030
Well, it says she's the Fairy of Finland, Futaba Aria. {sure why not}

00:04:28.030 --> 00:04:29.580
Futaba Aria...

00:04:29.580 --> 00:04:31.750
That name sounds familiar...

00:04:32.710 --> 00:04:34.000
Isn't she...

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:40.340
She's an idol gaining recognition worldwide who's rapidly rising though the Aikatsu Ranking.

00:04:40.340 --> 00:04:42.260
Wait, this girl...

00:04:42.260 --> 00:04:45.550
She's the fairy I was just talking about.

00:04:51.140 --> 00:04:53.560
What made you decide to pass on your brand?

00:04:53.560 --> 00:04:57.770
I found the perfect successor to My Little Heart.

00:04:57.770 --> 00:05:01.440
How will the brand change with the instatement of a new muse?

00:05:01.440 --> 00:05:05.660
She will enhance the brand with her own touch, but its core values will remain unaltered.

00:05:06.030 --> 00:05:09.870
Our feelings towards the brand are the same.

00:05:09.870 --> 00:05:12.410
What specifically are those feelings?

00:05:13.700 --> 00:05:16.790
The desire to create smiles with our dresses.

00:05:19.420 --> 00:05:23.920
She will be debuting a new Premium Rare Dress very soon.

00:05:23.920 --> 00:05:26.220
Please look forward to seeing it.

00:05:28.430 --> 00:05:32.560
Can we ask for a photo op with the new muse, Aria-san?

00:05:32.560 --> 00:05:33.810
Yes!

00:05:41.730 --> 00:05:43.030
Hime-senpai.

00:05:44.320 --> 00:05:46.280
So you came to see me, Yume-chan.

00:05:46.280 --> 00:05:51.200
I attended your Rainbow Berry Parfait event. Your rainbow coord was just lovely.

00:05:51.200 --> 00:05:52.830
Thank you.

00:05:53.740 --> 00:05:56.660
I read the article about My Little Heart.

00:05:56.660 --> 00:06:01.340
It said you were the one who invited Futaba Aria-chan to Japan.

00:06:01.340 --> 00:06:05.460
I saw one of her shows in Finland during my travels.

00:06:05.460 --> 00:06:09.140
That inspired me to bring her over here.

00:06:09.140 --> 00:06:13.220
Does that mean that in your search around the world,

00:06:13.220 --> 00:06:16.230
you found an answer in Futaba Aria-chan?

00:06:16.230 --> 00:06:20.980
<i>I'm taking a leave of absence from Four Star to travel the world.</i>

00:06:20.980 --> 00:06:23.440
<i>I understood after seeing Elza-chan.</i>

00:06:23.980 --> 00:06:27.240
<i>That there was something I was lacking.</i>

00:06:27.780 --> 00:06:29.950
<i>I'm going to go find it.</i>

00:06:31.410 --> 00:06:35.830
I wonder. Perhaps that's best left to you and Aria-chan.

00:06:38.000 --> 00:06:39.710
I'm back.

00:06:39.710 --> 00:06:43.090
They took lots of pictures of me.

00:06:43.090 --> 00:06:45.340
Aria-chan, where's your greeting?

00:06:46.170 --> 00:06:48.840
It's a pleasure to meet you. I'm Futaba Aria.

00:06:49.430 --> 00:06:51.220
This isn't our first time meeting.

00:06:51.220 --> 00:06:53.100
Oh, that's right.

00:06:54.010 --> 00:06:54.890
Huh?

00:06:54.890 --> 00:06:57.930
We happened to run into each other in the park the other day.

00:06:57.930 --> 00:07:04.190
While I was out on a morning stroll, 
the early birds invited me to sing with them.

00:07:04.190 --> 00:07:05.690
I see.

00:07:05.690 --> 00:07:09.820
Hime-chan has told me all about you, Nijino Yume-san.

00:07:09.820 --> 00:07:11.320
Just call me Yume.

00:07:11.320 --> 00:07:14.030
Then... Yume-chan.

00:07:17.500 --> 00:07:19.830
Yume-chan, this is for you.

00:07:21.870 --> 00:07:23.170
Wow!

00:07:23.170 --> 00:07:26.750
In flower language, gerbera means "constant progress".{I think we should a little obvious about this as a thing}

00:07:26.750 --> 00:07:29.130
I think it suits you perfectly!

00:07:29.130 --> 00:07:30.420
Take it.

00:07:30.420 --> 00:07:32.300
Th-Thank you.

00:07:34.140 --> 00:07:36.890
Nice! It's so very nice! {you'll be hearing this a lot}

00:07:36.890 --> 00:07:39.020
It's nice, really!

00:07:40.480 --> 00:07:43.020
Nice! So nice! {maybe it's because Japanese is not her first language? but she spoke to Hime as a child...}{maybe it's just really nice}

00:07:43.560 --> 00:07:44.610
Thanks.

00:07:44.610 --> 00:07:45.900
By the way,

00:07:45.900 --> 00:07:48.650
I have a request for you, Yume-chan.

00:07:48.650 --> 00:07:49.860
Okay?

00:07:52.110 --> 00:07:54.660
She wants to observe your work?

00:07:54.660 --> 00:07:58.040
Aria-chan doesn't have a firm grasp of Japanese Aikatsu yet.

00:07:58.870 --> 00:08:04.380
That's why she wants her to learn from various jobs before debuting her Premium Rare Dress.

00:08:04.380 --> 00:08:07.670
You can't get much more educational than S4's work.

00:08:07.670 --> 00:08:11.050
I know you have the experience to guide her properly.

00:08:11.050 --> 00:08:13.220
Yeah, I'll have to draw from all of it.

00:08:15.050 --> 00:08:17.430
I'll leave her in your hands, Yume-chan.

00:08:17.430 --> 00:08:18.350
Okay.

00:08:23.390 --> 00:08:25.690
What sort of work are you doing today?

00:08:25.690 --> 00:08:29.190
We're taking CD jacket pictures for my new single. {wait, CD case?}{the jacket is technically separate from the case but}

00:08:29.190 --> 00:08:34.700
The song carries a sense of nostalgia that also fills you with hope.

00:08:34.700 --> 00:08:37.740
Hearing it gives you a positive outlook on life.

00:08:38.450 --> 00:08:41.580
Wonderful. It's very wonderful!

00:08:57.390 --> 00:08:59.560
I can hear the wind.

00:09:00.810 --> 00:09:03.930
It's a comforting, pure sound.

00:09:08.730 --> 00:09:10.820
This is our backdrop for today.

00:09:14.110 --> 00:09:15.990
The air is fresh.

00:09:18.320 --> 00:09:19.700
You're right.

00:09:20.830 --> 00:09:22.330
Yume-chan!

00:09:22.950 --> 00:09:24.660
Good morning!

00:09:24.660 --> 00:09:26.210
Oh, hello!

00:09:26.210 --> 00:09:29.630
Aria-chan, Aikatsu always starts with a greeting.

00:09:29.630 --> 00:09:30.710
Okay!

00:09:33.130 --> 00:09:34.510
Good morning.

00:09:34.510 --> 00:09:36.260
Good morning!

00:09:36.260 --> 00:09:37.590
Good morning.

00:09:37.590 --> 00:09:39.220
Glad to have you today.

00:09:39.220 --> 00:09:40.100
Me too.

00:09:40.100 --> 00:09:44.680
This is Futaba Aria-chan. 
She'll be observing my work today.

00:09:44.680 --> 00:09:46.270
My name is Futaba Aria.

00:09:49.100 --> 00:09:51.730
If you'd like, please accept this.

00:09:54.240 --> 00:09:55.690
That's amazing.

00:09:55.690 --> 00:09:56.900
Was that magic?

00:10:02.540 --> 00:10:05.370
Attention, we're now starting the shoot.

00:10:05.370 --> 00:10:07.620
Please start posing.

00:10:07.620 --> 00:10:08.370
Okay.

00:10:09.630 --> 00:10:12.000
Yeah, that's a great smile.

00:10:12.630 --> 00:10:13.960
It's Yume-chan!

00:10:13.960 --> 00:10:15.880
S4 is so awesome.

00:10:15.880 --> 00:10:18.880
Nice. She's very nice.

00:10:19.260 --> 00:10:22.350
Yume-chan's Aikatsu is so very...

00:10:22.890 --> 00:10:26.890
Very, very, very...

00:10:26.890 --> 00:10:29.400
Yume-chan, that's it! Keep it up!

00:10:29.400 --> 00:10:31.730
Please give me more along those lines.

00:10:31.730 --> 00:10:32.650
Sure!

00:10:34.020 --> 00:10:34.900
H-Huh?

00:10:34.900 --> 00:10:38.070
Aria-chan, we can't take any pictures through you.

00:10:38.780 --> 00:10:40.530
I-I'm sorry!

00:10:40.530 --> 00:10:42.120
Aria-chan...

00:10:43.870 --> 00:10:45.700
Yeah, that's good!

00:10:52.330 --> 00:10:53.790
They all hit the mark.

00:10:53.790 --> 00:10:55.050
Which do you like?

00:10:55.050 --> 00:10:56.550
Let me see...

00:10:56.550 --> 00:11:00.970
Personally, I think this one matches the mood of the song.

00:11:00.970 --> 00:11:02.800
Yeah, I agree.

00:11:02.800 --> 00:11:04.850
What do you think, Aria-chan?

00:11:07.730 --> 00:11:12.350
Aikatsu is fun. Would you like to Aikatsu with me?

00:11:12.350 --> 00:11:13.230
What?

00:11:13.230 --> 00:11:14.730
We couldn't...

00:11:17.320 --> 00:11:19.110
Break time!

00:11:19.110 --> 00:11:20.570
Everything's running smoothly.

00:11:20.570 --> 00:11:21.610
I'm glad.

00:11:20.570 --> 00:11:23.530
I'm ready, Aria-chan. Let's eat...

00:11:23.530 --> 00:11:24.740
Huh?

00:11:28.290 --> 00:11:30.920
Aria-chan? Aria-chan.

00:11:31.540 --> 00:11:33.580
I can hear the flowers.

00:11:34.710 --> 00:11:35.750
This land...

00:11:36.550 --> 00:11:40.630
It's full of the sounds of nature, just like my homeland.

00:11:40.630 --> 00:11:43.140
You're from Finland, right?

00:11:43.140 --> 00:11:46.930
Yes. We had a piano on the bank of a lake.

00:11:46.930 --> 00:11:51.230
When I was little, Hime-chan taught me how to play it.

00:11:51.230 --> 00:11:53.400
You learned from her?

00:12:17.290 --> 00:12:19.510
Aria-chan, you're really good!

00:12:19.510 --> 00:12:21.800
Aikachu is very fun!

00:12:21.800 --> 00:12:23.930
It's very fun!

00:12:23.930 --> 00:12:24.890
Yeah!

00:12:26.430 --> 00:12:29.600
So you knew each other as children.

00:12:29.600 --> 00:12:35.060
Yes, I admired her for teaching me the fun of Aikatsu.

00:12:35.060 --> 00:12:36.520
Same as me.

00:12:37.520 --> 00:12:41.190
She's the object of my admiration too.

00:12:41.940 --> 00:12:44.700
We really are the same!

00:12:44.700 --> 00:12:46.620
Hey, Aria-chan.

00:12:47.320 --> 00:12:49.370
Let's Aikatsu together!

00:13:04.760 --> 00:13:08.550
Hime-senpai gave me permission to include you in the shoot.

00:13:08.550 --> 00:13:10.810
Yay, I'm happy!

00:13:11.390 --> 00:13:13.230
Yay!

00:13:14.390 --> 00:13:16.020
A-Are you okay?

00:13:17.900 --> 00:13:19.020
Yes!

00:13:20.770 --> 00:13:23.400
Now then, about the theme.

00:13:23.400 --> 00:13:27.280
How about we try for a fairy straight out of a fairy tale?

00:13:28.160 --> 00:13:30.410
Sure, let's roll with that.

00:13:39.040 --> 00:13:41.250
You two are doing great!

00:13:42.170 --> 00:13:43.920
Yeah, keep it up!

00:13:53.810 --> 00:13:57.190
Okay! Let's take a few of you singing.

00:13:57.190 --> 00:13:58.230
Got it.

00:14:23.630 --> 00:14:26.170
Chief, this is... {because whatever}

00:14:26.170 --> 00:14:27.880
A miracle?

00:14:28.590 --> 00:14:32.390
<i>It's incredible. In response to Aria-chan's singing,</i>

00:14:32.390 --> 00:14:34.770
<i>the whole forest is rejoicing! {this is a weird one}{I'd recommend "the forest is rejoicing" if you deem there to be sufficient treecover}</i>

00:14:35.470 --> 00:14:36.730
<i>It's smiling!</i>

00:14:55.450 --> 00:14:59.160
Aria-chan really does love Aikatsu. {for the sign: Aikatsu starts with Aikatsu?}

00:15:00.580 --> 00:15:02.170
I love it...

00:15:03.630 --> 00:15:06.170
So that's how your day went.

00:15:06.170 --> 00:15:08.420
That Aria girl gets me going.

00:15:08.420 --> 00:15:11.680
She reminds me of you last year, Yume.{not all our viewers have ears}{okay, but we do have an explicit disclaimer on our site saying we assume they do}

00:15:12.090 --> 00:15:13.470
Me?

00:15:13.470 --> 00:15:14.850
Straightforward...

00:15:14.850 --> 00:15:16.010
Sincere...

00:15:16.010 --> 00:15:18.480
And always off in your own world.

00:15:18.480 --> 00:15:20.480
You enjoy your Aikatsu...

00:15:20.480 --> 00:15:22.480
Absorb everything you can...

00:15:22.480 --> 00:15:26.230
And your mind is perpetually lost in fairy-tale land!{I... think this works a little better even if not the flowers?}{I guess both refer to Aria}

00:15:26.230 --> 00:15:28.530
Hey, Ako-chan! That was mean!

00:15:28.530 --> 00:15:30.450
I only stated the truth.

00:15:31.490 --> 00:15:34.070
In any case, I'm looking forward to her show.

00:15:34.070 --> 00:15:35.660
Wanna see it together?

00:15:35.660 --> 00:15:37.120
Sure!

00:15:48.340 --> 00:15:51.590
I hope Aria-chan isn't too nervous.

00:15:53.510 --> 00:15:54.600
Aria-chan?

00:15:54.600 --> 00:15:56.600
Huh? She's not here.

00:15:56.600 --> 00:15:58.810
It's almost time to start, too.

00:15:58.810 --> 00:15:59.890
Yume-chan.

00:16:00.600 --> 00:16:02.350
Hime-senpai.

00:16:02.350 --> 00:16:05.610
If you're looking for Aria-chan, she's likely out on the terrace.{I'll allow this one since length, but}

00:16:05.610 --> 00:16:07.150
The terrace?

00:16:12.150 --> 00:16:13.360
She's really here.

00:16:13.860 --> 00:16:14.870
Aria-chan.

00:16:14.870 --> 00:16:17.120
You need to come in soon.

00:16:18.160 --> 00:16:20.120
I can hear the wind.

00:16:21.410 --> 00:16:23.620
Please listen closely.

00:16:24.250 --> 00:16:25.880
The sound of wind.

00:16:25.880 --> 00:16:27.630
The sound of flowers.

00:16:27.630 --> 00:16:29.130
The sound of greenery.

00:16:29.710 --> 00:16:33.680
All of those sounds make up the rhythms of nature.

00:16:33.680 --> 00:16:35.550
When the rhythms combine...

00:16:43.640 --> 00:16:45.520
A melody is born!

00:17:04.160 --> 00:17:06.670
My first Premium Rare Dress.

00:17:07.040 --> 00:17:12.170
The Floral Fantasia Coord is adorned with my favorite flowers and plants.

00:17:12.840 --> 00:17:16.050
May the flower of Aikatsu bloom!{could go literaler just in case, like "let us make the flower of aikatsu bloom"}

00:20:34.330 --> 00:20:37.420
Wow... just great, Aria-chan!

00:20:50.970 --> 00:20:52.060
Come in.

00:20:53.980 --> 00:20:58.610
Congratulations on an excellent first show in Japan. You were fantastic.

00:20:58.610 --> 00:21:00.900
Thank you very much.

00:21:00.900 --> 00:21:03.990
Is this a Star Premium Rare Coord?

00:21:03.990 --> 00:21:09.080
That's right. This coord was made for a lover of nature like you.

00:21:09.080 --> 00:21:10.370
Congrats again!

00:21:12.120 --> 00:21:13.370
Aria-chan!

00:21:13.370 --> 00:21:14.710
Yume-chan!

00:21:14.710 --> 00:21:17.750
Oh, Hime-senpai! Sorry for interrupting.

00:21:17.750 --> 00:21:20.800
Aria-chan, that performance was the best!

00:21:20.800 --> 00:21:22.420
It was so pure!

00:21:22.420 --> 00:21:25.090
The whole audience left with a smile!

00:21:25.090 --> 00:21:27.140
You cleansed my heart! {I was not expecting this phrase to be the 洗う version}{wow, unexpected}

00:21:27.140 --> 00:21:30.640
We could tell just how much you enjoy Aikatsu.

00:21:30.640 --> 00:21:33.140
Th-Thank you.

00:21:33.140 --> 00:21:34.390
Oh, sorry!

00:21:34.390 --> 00:21:36.230
We never introduced ourselves.

00:21:36.230 --> 00:21:38.900
I already know who you are.

00:21:38.900 --> 00:21:41.530
I'm very happy to finally meet you.

00:21:46.570 --> 00:21:48.570
For Rola-san, a peony.

00:21:49.990 --> 00:21:52.240
For Mahiru-san, an orchid.

00:21:52.240 --> 00:21:54.250
For Ako-san, a pansy.

00:21:54.250 --> 00:21:56.500
And for Koharu-san, a marguerite.

00:21:56.500 --> 00:21:58.880
How adorable!

00:22:00.040 --> 00:22:01.630
I'm so happy.

00:22:02.000 --> 00:22:06.380
I have Hime-chan and Yume-chan, and all you wonderful senpai.

00:22:06.380 --> 00:22:11.890
I'm very happy thinking about all the Aikatsu we can do together!

00:22:14.350 --> 00:22:15.020
Yeah!

00:22:15.020 --> 00:22:16.520
Me too!

00:22:16.520 --> 00:22:18.020
All together!

00:22:18.020 --> 00:22:20.810
Aikatsu!

00:23:56.280 --> 00:24:00.370
The Floral Fantasia Coord has a strong flower motif.

00:24:00.370 --> 00:24:04.380
You looked like a real fairy with the Star Wings on your back.

00:24:04.380 --> 00:24:09.420
As Hime-chan's successor at My Little Heart, I'll make the flower of Aikatsu bloom!

00:24:11.930 --> 00:24:13.680
So this is Venus Ark!

00:24:13.680 --> 00:24:15.890
We welcome you aboard!

00:24:15.890 --> 00:24:18.390
And while you're here, wanna enroll?

00:24:18.390 --> 00:24:20.430
Next time on Aikatsu Stars!

00:24:20.430 --> 00:24:21.980
Through Flower Language. {meaning}

00:24:21.980 --> 00:24:24.440
Become the first-star idol!
